# Sounio Loom Multiplexer

Concept-ID: `SOUNIO-LOOM-MULTIPLEXER`

Status: executable for Loom-1.6 on one Unix host, including one-shot post-Pod
desired-state reconciliation, non-rolling Kubernetes activation, and a
source-derived, separate-Pod shadow-canary-tested Beagle supervisor bridge.
Project Cockpit source renders fail-closed lineage evidence, and a separate
Sounio nominal kernel distinguishes unsigned, signed, and independently
observed promotion-specific continuity proof types. The shared coordinator provides generation-scoped
at-least-once wake replay with same-generation deduplication and durable ACK
suppression. A four-Pod canary relocated compute from t560-proxmox to
r740-proxmox over one retained Ceph RBD RWOP volume and preserved a publicly
verifiable Ed25519 predecessor chain. This is a bounded systems witness, not a
state-replication, novelty, priority, distributed-availability,
production-Beagle, or storage-loss claim.

